## Findings

### Assignments (Guard)
**URL:** `https://staging-store.parwestgroup.com/inventory-assignements/create`

**Form Fields:**
- **Select Store**: Select
- **Search Guard (Parwest ID)**: Input with AJAX search
- **Assigned At**: Date
- **Select Product**: Autocomplete search
- **Products Table**: Dynamic (Columns: Name, Code, Quantity, Condition [Select: New, Reusable, Used, Damaged, Condemned, Stolen])
- **Remarks**: Textarea

### Client Assignments
**URL:** `https://staging-store.parwestgroup.com/client-assignments/create`

**Form Fields:**
- **Select Store**: Select
- **Select Client**: Select2
- **Select Branch**: Select2
- **Assigned At**: Date
- **Select Product**: Autocomplete search
- **Products Table**: Dynamic (Columns: Name, Code, Calibre, Weapon Type, Quantity, Condition)
- **Remarks**: Textarea

### Product Definition (Unified)
**Form Fields (Add Product):**
- **Product Name**: Input
- **Product Code**: Input
- **Product Category**: Select
- **Product Unit**: Select
- **Weapon Type**: Select (Optional)
- **Calibre**: Select (Optional)
- **Description**: Textarea
- **Product Image**: File
- **Has Variant**: Checkbox
**URL:** `https://staging-store.parwestgroup.com/adjustments`

**Form Fields (Add Adjustment):**
- **Store/Warehouse**: Select2
- **Select Product**: Autocomplete search
- **Products Table**: Dynamic (Columns: Name, Code, Current Stock, Type [Addition/Subtraction])
- **Note**: Textarea

### Products (Definition)
**Form Fields (Add/Update):**
- **Product Name**: Input
- **Product Code**: Input
- **Product Category**: Select
- **Product Unit**: Select
- **Weapon Type**: Select
- **Calibre**: Select
- **Description**: Textarea
- **Product Image**: File upload
- **Has Variant**: Checkbox

### Purchases
**URL:** `https://staging-store.parwestgroup.com/purchases/create/regular`

**Form Fields (Add Purchase):**
- **Select Store/Warehouse**: Select2
- **Select Vendor**: Select2
- **Attachment Invoices**: File upload
- **Purchase Date**: Date picker
- **Select Product**: Autocomplete search / Barcode scanner
- **Products Table**: Dynamic (Columns: Name, Code, Calibre, Type, New Stock, Reusable Stock, Quantity, Price, Total Price)
- **Note**: Textarea
- **Approval Reference**: Input
- **Invoice Number**: Input

